{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "FlowerField",
    "steam_appid": 2852120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852120/extras/48f4ebf07f513d73a1a3845f72730fba.avif?t=1742588018\" width=462 height=174 /></span><br><br>Collect all the flowers you can find and complete your collection! Some of them could even grow on concrete, while others will only thrive if you create their ideal conditions. Find information about their various quirks and gradually expand your herbarium.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852120/extras/5e8e687e646c8a1956e175697fd0b1e9.avif?t=1742588018\" width=462 height=174 /></span><br><br>Experience your garden in completely different ways at different times during the day. Some flowers go to rest at night, others only unfold in full moonlight. Lock the daytime if you only want to enjoy day or night (daylight/night mode).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852120/extras/ff488821025a9189685b93d3a5148a0f.avif?t=1742588018\" width=462 height=174 /></span><br><br>Your flowers respond to weather changes in various ways. Some enjoy a fresh shower of rain, while others would rather hide under a rock.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852120/extras/068d32176a8342e5734a8132ca5adbb8.avif?t=1742588018\" width=462 height=174 /></span><br><br>You decide where on your screen you'd like to garden. Simply select the edges you want to play on when creating your garden. Depending on the settings, you can even move the game area a little!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852120/extras/48f4ebf07f513d73a1a3845f72730fba.avif?t=1742588018\" width=462 height=174 /></span><br><br>Collect all the flowers you can find and complete your collection! Some of them could even grow on concrete, while others will only thrive if you create their ideal conditions. Find information about their various quirks and gradually expand your herbarium.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852120/extras/5e8e687e646c8a1956e175697fd0b1e9.avif?t=1742588018\" width=462 height=174 /></span><br><br>Experience your garden in completely different ways at different times during the day. Some flowers go to rest at night, others only unfold in full moonlight. Lock the daytime if you only want to enjoy day or night (daylight/night mode).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852120/extras/ff488821025a9189685b93d3a5148a0f.avif?t=1742588018\" width=462 height=174 /></span><br><br>Your flowers respond to weather changes in various ways. Some enjoy a fresh shower of rain, while others would rather hide under a rock.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852120/extras/068d32176a8342e5734a8132ca5adbb8.avif?t=1742588018\" width=462 height=174 /></span><br><br>You decide where on your screen you'd like to garden. Simply select the edges you want to play on when creating your garden. Depending on the settings, you can even move the game area a little!",
    "short_description": "Tend and cultivate your personal little garden while you are actually working on other things. Choose for yourself in which screen areas you want to play and and watch your plants grow.",
